        },
        {
            "+content": "Kokoro Shimizu is an ordinary (if somewhat short) girl and also one of the lucky few to play Monster Evolve Online, the latest hit VRMMO. But while everyone else is busy optimizing their teams and tackling the wilds beyond the city walls, Kokoro has a much simpler goal in mind: to relax. Life is stressful enough as it is, so she doesn't need a video game that stresses her out too. Determined to take things at her own pace, Kokoro immediately sets out to find the perfect way to chill. And what better way than to befriend a new cute, cuddly companion. Naturally, that means she'll need a Slime as her first partner. Forget dangerous battles and daring adventures. For now, Kokoro and her Slime are here to use their time to the fullest—and it all begins with crafting potions. <em class=de-emphasized>(from manga light novel)</em>",
